    <tib>gshin rje d+mar po bshan pa las kyi rgyud ces bya ba/ spu gri reg chod ru mtshon d+mar po'i drag sngags</tib>
    <skt>ya ma ra ga ka ra ma ru tsa tan+t+ra nA ma</skt>
